      "justification": "Direct match; loop back notation describes intended flow without altering meaning."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "they should upgrade the test level."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match of the upgrade step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "they need to check if the level satisfies the project requirements again."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match of the repeated requirement check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it does, the process ends. If not, they should upgrade the test level once more."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the second requirement evaluation and decision gateway."
    },
